OL,3,GNEWSARiver Mersey tidal power project
OL,4,Alocation revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe preferred location for a
OL,7,F"potentially transformational" tidal
OL,8,Fpower scheme on the River Mersey has
OL,9,Fbeen revealed.
OL,11,FThe proposed barrage has been a
OL,12,Flong-time ambition of Liverpool City
OL,13,FRegion Mayor Steve Rotheram who said he
OL,14,Fwants to harness the power of the
OL,15,Friver.
OL,17,FA 1.5 mile (2.4km) stretch of the River
OL,18,FMersey between Bromborough in Wirral
OL,19,Fand Otterspool in Liverpool has now
OL,20,Fbeen identified as the preferred area
OL,21,Ffor the project.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
