OL,3,GNEWSARiver Mersey tidal power project
OL,4,Alocation revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Liverpool City Region Combined
OL,7,FAuthority will be asked to approve the
OL,8,Flocation at a meeting on 6 November. No
OL,9,Fconstruction work can take place until
OL,10,Fa Development Consent Order is granted
OL,11,Fand investment is in place.
